    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The system enforcer moved to restore order after a perception puppeteer exploited information asymmetry for profit. This individual created and disseminated misleading digital content, using AI-generated audio to claim an actor dated a minor. Authorities countered the manipulation with an arrest warrant, leading to the subject being detained. The manufactured narrative had already triggered systemic paralysis, causing a complete halt to the celebrity's endorsements and public appearances since early 2025.",
